--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PARITY NOTES (cross-platform value parity, NOT a "corrected" version)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  STATUS_MAP reproduced: installed=checkmark.circle.fill/success/info ; installing=arrow.down.circle/
    warning/warning ; downloading=arrow.down.circle/info(blue) ; available=square.and.arrow.down/neutral/
    info ; scheduled=clock/purple/info ; default=square.and.arrow.down/neutral/info. Web hex colors mapped
    onto the generated Color.TS palette (success/warning/chartSeriesSpeed/textMuted/chartSeriesPower).
  feedItems: isCurrent = (original index 0 && status==installed) -> checkmark + cyan(chartSeriesRegen) +
    "Current" subtitle ; timestamp = installedAt ?? scheduledAt ?? createdAt ?? epoch(0) ; sorted by
    timestamp DESC ; sliced to maxItems=15 ; missing version -> em-dash. (matches feedItems useMemo +
    WidgetEventFeed.)
  CompactView: latest = list[0] (NOT newest) ; badge = installed?"Current"/success : installing?status/
    warning : status/info.
  formatRelativeTime: <1m "Just now" ; <60m "{m}m ago" ; <24h "{h}h ago" ; else locale absolute date-time.
  i18n: every web key present in the catalog (widget.softwareUpdateHistory, widget.updateCurrent,
    widget.updateStatus, widget.noUpdates); the raw web status string is localized via explicit per-status
    keys; no English literal ships (all via SoftwareUpdateHistoryStrings).

